  "question": {
    "text": "A particle is thrown over a triangle from one end of a horizontal base and after grazing the vertex falls on the other end of the base. If <math> <mrow> <mi>α</mi> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;and <math> <mrow> <mi>β</mi> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;be the base angles and <math> <mrow> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;be the angle of projection. Find the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi></math><math> <mrow> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </math>."
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>&alpha;</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>&beta;</mi> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>sin</mtext> <mi>&alpha;</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>sin</mtext> <mi>&beta;</mi> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>&alpha;</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>sin</mtext> <mi>&beta;</mi> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>cos</mtext> <mi>&alpha;</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>cos</mtext> <mi>&alpha;</mi> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "The situation is shown in diagram<br /><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0007_ca5d23c82360.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 183px; height: 152px;\" /></strong></u><br /><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>&alpha;</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>&beta;</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>y</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>y</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>R</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>x</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>&alpha;</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>&beta;</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>yR</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>R</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>x</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;...(i)<br /><br />Equation of trajectory is &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mtext>y</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>x tan&nbsp;</mtext> <mi>&theta;&nbsp;</mi> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>R</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><br />or,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>&theta;</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>yR</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>R</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>x</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;...(ii)<br /><br />From Eqs. (i) and (ii), we have<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>&theta;</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>&alpha;</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>&beta;</mi> </mrow> </math>"
  }
